title: "VisIVO Visual Analytics"
abstract: "A hybrid desktop–service visual analytics platform for astronomical data cubes: a Qt 6/VTK 9 client and a REST compute service that run embedded on a laptop or next to the data, with a kinematic lasso for PPV source selection, interactive tilted-ring modelling and persistent, replayable analysis products."
